e, and communications payloads. Leidos Holdings, Inc. was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Reston, Virginia.", "marketCap": 14908972032, "beta": 0.544, "divYield": 1.41, "pe": 10.921359, "ps": 0.837818, "debtToEquity": 125.627, "prices": [["2016-11-21", 42.82], ["2016-11-28", 44.18], ["2016-12-05", 44.77], ["2016-12-12", 44.12], ["2016-12-19", 44.03], ["2016-12-26", 44.1], ["2017-01-02", 43.68], ["2017-01-09", 43.08], ["2017-01-16", 42.82], ["2017-01-23", 42.73], ["2017-01-30", 42.85], ["2017-02-06", 43.84], ["2017-02-13", 44.8], ["2017-02-20", 46.63], ["2017-02-27", 46.3], ["2017-03-06", 45.54], ["2017-03-13", 46.8], ["2017-03-20", 45.65], ["2017-03-27", 44.37], ["2017-04-03", 43.92], ["2017-04-10", 43.93], ["2017-04-17", 45.29], ["2017-04-24", 45.68], ["2017-05-01", 47.25], ["2017-05-08", 45.69], ["2017-05-15", 45.21], ["2017-05-22", 47.61], ["2017-05-29", 48.54], ["2017-06-05", 48.04], ["2017-06-12", 47.1], ["2017-06-19", 46.73], ["2017-06-26", 45.1], ["2017-07-03", 45.43], ["2017-07-10", 46.45], ["2017-07-17", 46.63], ["2017-07-24", 46.77], ["2017-07-31", 49.03], ["2017-08-07", 49.46], ["2017-08-14", 48.29], ["2017-08-21", 48.74], ["2017-08-28", 51.25], ["2017-09-04", 49.83], ["2017-09-11", 49.49], ["2017-09-18", 51.63], ["2017-09-25", 51.97], ["2017-10-02", 54.19], ["2017-10-09", 55.07], ["2017-10-16", 54.57], ["2017-10-23", 54.72], ["2017-10-30", 55.86], ["2017-11-06", 54.29], ["2017-11-13", 53.61], ["2017-11-20", 53.8], ["2017-11-27", 54.69], ["2017-12-04", 56.28], ["2017-12-11", 56.97], ["2017-12-18", 57.52], ["2017-12-25", 56.95], ["2018-01-01", 57.09], ["2018-01-08", 59.12], ["2018-01-15", 59.21], ["2018-01-22", 58.47], ["2018-01-29", 58.41], ["2018-02-05", 55.23], ["2018-02-12", 58.58], ["2018-02-19", 58.06], ["2018-02-26", 57.33], ["2018-03-05", 61.23], ["2018-03-12", 59.99], ["2018-03-19", 57.61], ["2018-03-26", 57.95], ["2018-04-02", 57.47], ["2018-04-09", 57.8], ["2018-04-16", 58.59], ["2018-04-23", 58.28], ["2018-04-30", 53.28], ["2018-05-07",